2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (State\055of\055the\055Art\072\040DTM\040Generation\040Using\040Airborne\040LIDAR\040Data\056)
/Author (Ziyue\040Chen\054\040Bingbo\040Gao\054\040Bernard\040Devereux)
/Subject (Digital\040terrain\040model\040\050DTM\051\040generation\040is\040the\040fundamental\040application\040of\040airborne\040Lidar\040data\056\040In\040past\040decades\054\040a\040large\040body\040of\040studies\040has\040been\040conducted\040to\040present\040and\040experiment\040a\040variety\040of\040DTM\040generation\040methods\056\040Although\040great\040progress\040has\040been\040made\054\040DTM\040generation\054\040especially\040DTM\040generation\040in\040specific\040terrain\040situations\054\040remains\040challenging\056\040This\040research\040introduces\040the\040general\040principles\040of\040DTM\040generation\040and\040reviews\040diverse\040mainstream\040DTM\040generation\040methods\056\040In\040accordance\040with\040the\040filtering\040strategy\054\040these\040methods\040are\040classified\040into\040six\040categories\072\040surface\055based\040adjustment\073\040morphology\055based\040filtering\054\040triangulated\040irregular\040network\040\050TIN\051\055based\040refinement\054\040segmentation\040and\040classification\054\040statistical\040analysis\040and\040multi\055scale\040comparison\056\040Typical\040methods\040for\040each\040category\040are\040briefly\040introduced\040and\040the\040merits\040and\040limitations\040of\040each\040category\040are\040discussed\040accordingly\056\040Despite\040different\040categories\040of\040filtering\040strategies\054\040these\040DTM\040generation\040methods\040present\040similar\040difficulties\040when\040implemented\040in\040sharply\040changing\040terrain\054\040areas\040with\040dense\040non\055ground\040features\040and\040complicated\040landscapes\056\040This\040paper\040suggests\040that\040the\040fusion\040of\040multi\055sources\040and\040integration\040of\040different\040methods\040can\040be\040effective\040ways\040for\040improving\040the\040performance\040of\040DTM\040generation\056)
/Keywords (14\040Jan\0402017\054\040Sensors\054\040Triangulated\040irregular\040network\054\040Beijing\040Normal\040University\054\040Center\040for\040Information\040Technology\054\040University\040of\040Cambridge)
>>
endobj
